      <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>The camera shows water falling at this exact moment: It’s <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="raining" data-hint="An event visibly in progress uses the -ing form." data-fix="It’s raining at this exact moment." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> at this exact moment.</span></div>
